EA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-4173250-A" status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>4173250</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y"  name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-8300694-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>8300694</doc-number> <kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="US-5455610-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>US</country> <doc-number>5455610</doc-number> <kind>A</kind> </document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1167045A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>COPYER CO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUGIYAMA YUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>COPYER CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGIYAMA, YUICHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUGIYAMA YUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGIYAMA, YUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A first black print head (12a1) and color print heads (12b1 - 12b3) are aligned in the direction a carriage moves. A second black print head (12a2) is deviated in the paper feed direction from the first black print head (12a1) and color print heads (12b1 - 12b3). Color image data are printed by the second black print head (12a2) and the color print heads (12b1 - 12b3). As a result, adjacent black and color dots are simultaneously printed less frequently, thus reducing smears. Black and white image data are printed by the two black heads (12a1, 12a2) at higher speed.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Une première tête d'impression noire (12a1) et des têtes d'impression couleur (12b1 - 12b3) sont alignées dans la direction d'avance du chariot. Une deuxième tête d'impression noire (12a2) est déviée dans la direction d'alimentation en papier depuis la première tête d'impression noire (12a1) et des têtes d'impression couleur (12b1 - 12b3). Des données d'image en couleur sont imprimées par la deuxième tête d'impression noire (12a2) et les têtes d'impression couleur (12b1 - 12b3). Ainsi donc des points noir et de points couleur adjacents sont imprimées moins fréquemment, réduisant ainsi les bavures. Des données d'image blanc et noir sont imprimées par les deux têtes d'image noires (12a1, 12a2) à une vitesse supérieure.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>